WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:07.620
"I can't wait to see the Metro City Rocket Dancers!" Jack said.

2
00:00:07.621 --> 00:00:10.443
Roxy and her friends were at lunch.

3
00:00:10.444 --> 00:00:19.844
"Me neither," Mara said. "This year their holiday show is all about Rocket Girl!"

4
00:00:19.845 --> 00:00:22.205
Terrell nudged Roxy with his elbow.

5
00:00:22.206 --> 00:00:26.322
"It will be a fun show. Right, Roxy?"

6
00:00:26.323 --> 00:00:30.089
Roxy shrugged. "I guess."

7
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.501
Principal Penn's voice came over the loudspeaker.

8
00:00:33.502 --> 00:00:36.235
"I have bad news, everyone.

9
00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:40.556
We won't get to see the Metro City Rocket Dancers on Friday.

10
00:00:40.557 --> 00:00:44.167
The show has been canceled."

11
00:00:44.168 --> 00:00:47.912
"Oh no!" Mara said.

12
00:00:47.913 --> 00:00:50.725
Jack and Terrell looked disappointed too.

13
00:00:50.726 --> 00:00:55.174
Roxy was relieved. "Yes!" she thought.

14
00:00:55.175 --> 00:01:00.046
"I don't have to see that boring show again!"

15
00:01:00.047 --> 00:01:03.254
Soon everyone ran outside for recess.

16
00:01:03.255 --> 00:01:09.721
Roxy and her friends joined a soccer game.

17
00:01:09.722 --> 00:01:13.685
"This is great!" Roxy thought as she dribbled the ball.

18
00:01:13.686 --> 00:01:19.349
"I'm playing soccer, and that boring show was—" Her watch beeped.

19
00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:24.335
As Roxy looked down, another kid stole the ball.

20
00:01:24.336 --> 00:01:32.091
Roxy sighed and walked off the field.

21
00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:37.175
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy said. "What's wrong?"

22
00:01:37.176 --> 00:01:41.872
"One of the Metro City Rocket Dancers is missing," Mayor Bloom said.

23
00:01:41.873 --> 00:01:47.201
"We think she was kidnapped. Detective Smith is at her apartment."

24
00:01:47.202 --> 00:01:49.273
He gave Roxy the address.

25
00:01:49.274 --> 00:01:57.357
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said. "I'll find that missing dancer!"

26
00:01:57.358 --> 00:02:00.104
Roxy arrived at the apartment.

27
00:02:00.105 --> 00:02:03.168
The door was broken.

28
00:02:03.169 --> 00:02:05.795
Detective Smith was in the kitchen.

29
00:02:05.796 --> 00:02:09.754
Cereal was all over the floor.

30
00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:17.143
"Hey, Detective," Roxy said. "It looks like you made a big mess!"

31
00:02:17.144 --> 00:02:25.702
Detective Smith frowned. "Very funny. I didn't make this mess, Rocket Girl."

32
00:02:25.703 --> 00:02:30.466
Roxy looked around. "Did you find any clues?"

33
00:02:30.467 --> 00:02:36.549
Detective Smith sighed. "It looks like the kidnapper broke the door.

34
00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:41.471
The dancer was probably eating breakfast." He shook his head.

35
00:02:41.472 --> 00:02:45.685
"Why would someone kidnap one of the Rocket Dancers?

36
00:02:45.686 --> 00:02:48.112
They put on such a great show."

37
00:02:48.113 --> 00:02:54.308
Roxy rolled her eyes. "I saw the show, and it was pretty terrible.

38
00:02:54.309 --> 00:02:57.804
But that's no reason to kidnap one of the dancers."

39
00:02:57.805 --> 00:03:01.075
The detective's phone rang.

40
00:03:01.076 --> 00:03:06.967
"Hello? Oh no! We'll be right there!" He hung up.

41
00:03:06.968 --> 00:03:09.853
"Another dancer was just kidnapped.

42
00:03:09.854 --> 00:03:17.644
She was at Metro City Music Hall. We need to . . . Rocket Girl?"

43
00:03:17.645 --> 00:03:20.890
Roxy flew into the music hall.

44
00:03:20.891 --> 00:03:27.149
A dancer hurried over. "Rocket Girl! I'm so glad you're here!

45
00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:30.123
Now two dancers are missing!"

46
00:03:30.124 --> 00:03:34.523
"I heard," Roxy said. "Can you tell me what happened?

47
00:03:34.524 --> 00:03:36.988
Did you see anyone suspicious?"

48
00:03:36.989 --> 00:03:42.122
"Rocket Girl!" Suddenly another dancer ran over.

49
00:03:42.123 --> 00:03:48.273
"A gorilla just kidnapped Vera!"

